{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Reach Out — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name='description' content='Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for integrative, whole-person care. Book an intensive consultation or ask about our approach.'>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg1:#f6fbf8;
      --bg2:#fffefc;
      --accent:#6c63ff;
      --muted:#6a6f75;
      --card:#ffffff;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(40,41,61,0.08);
      --radius:14px;
      --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:var(--sans);color:#24303a;background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));}
    .site{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    /* decorative svg sits behind content */
    .art{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.18}

    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 36px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#2bd6c5);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    .brand h1{font-size:16px;margin:0}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}
    nav a.active,nav a:hover{background:var(--glass);color:#17202a}

    main{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;padding:36px;align-items:start}

    /* Hero / Contact form card */
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(255,255,255,0.85));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .hero h2{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px;color:#122022}
    .hero p{margin:0 0 18px 0;color:var(--muted)}

    form.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    label{font-size:13px;color:#334047;margin-bottom:6px}
    input[type='text'],input[type='email'],input[type='tel'],textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6ecea;background:transparent;font-size:14px}
    textarea{grid-column:1/-1;min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .wide{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;gap:12px}
    .checkboxes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    .pill{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #e5efea;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f8fffd);font-size:13px}

    .actions{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#2bd6c5);color:white;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:none;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6ecea;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}

    /* sidebar */
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.95),rgba(255,255,255,0.9));padding:20px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:sticky;top:28px}
    .card h3{margin:0 0 8px 0}
    .meta{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px}
    .contact-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .pill-info{background:#f1fbfa;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:#0f3b35;font-weight:600}

    /* mini sections */
    .testimonials{margin-top:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .testi{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #f0f6f5}
    .testi small{color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:8px}

    .faq{margin-top:18px}
    .faq-item{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfffe);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eef7f5;margin-bottom:8px}
    .faq-item summary{font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    details[open] summary{color:var(--accent)}

    footer{padding:20px 36px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width:920px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:20px} .card{position:relative;top:auto}}

    /* playful small touches */
    .sparkle{display:inline-block;margin-left:8px;font-size:18px;transform:translateY(1px)}
    .map{height:160px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef9f7,#f6fbff);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#5d7771;border:1px dashed rgba(91,115,108,0.12)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='site'>
    <!-- Decorative SVG pattern. Save a copy as assets/img/pattern.svg for reuse (see README). -->
    <svg class='art' viewBox='0 0 1000 600' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid slice' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>
          <stop offset='0' stop-color='#fff6fb' stop-opacity='0.9'/>
          <stop offset='1' stop-color='#f6fffb' stop-opacity='0.7'/>
        </linearGradient>
        <radialGradient id='g2' cx='30%' cy='20%'>
          <stop offset='0' stop-color='#ffd7ff' stop-opacity='0.06'/>
          <stop offset='1' stop-color='#6c63ff' stop-opacity='0.02'/>
        </radialGradient>
        <pattern id='dots' x='0' y='0' width='120' height='120' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'>
          <circle cx='10' cy='10' r='2' fill='#cfeee6' />
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#g1)' />
      <g transform='translate(60,40)'>
        <circle cx='820' cy='80' r='180' fill='url(#g2)' />
        <rect x='0' y='80' width='420' height='420' fill='url(#dots)' opacity='0.45' />
        <path d='M220 400 C 320 320, 420 420, 520 360 C 620 300, 720 420, 820 340 L 1000 500 L 0 500 Z' fill='#e6fff8' opacity='0.9' />
      </g>
    </svg>

    <header>
      <div class='brand'>
        <div class='logo' aria-hidden='true'>HM</div>
        <div>
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Integrative, whole-person care</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label='Primary navigation'>
        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
        <a href='services.html'>Care</a>
        <a href='conditions.html'>Conditions</a>
        <a href='approach.html'>Our Way</a>
        <a href='pricing.html'>Plans</a>
        <a href='about.html'>Meet</a>
        <a class='active' href='contact.html'>Reach Us</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class='hero' aria-labelledby='contact-heading'>
        <h2 id='contact-heading'>Say hello — let's design your intensive path</h2>
        <p>Prefer a focused, in-depth intake? Our intensive consultations are crafted to map your whole-person story — lifestyle, labs, and listening. No promises, just thoughtful guidance.</p>

        <form id='contactForm' class='fields' autocomplete='off'>
          <div class='field'>
            <label for='name'>Full name</label>
            <input id='name' name='name' type='text' placeholder='Your name' required>
          </div>

          <div class='field'>
            <label for='email'>Email</label>
            <input id='email' name='email' type='email' placeholder='you@domain.com' required>
          </div>

          <div class='field'>
            <label for='phone'>Phone</label>
            <input id='phone' name='phone' type='tel' placeholder='(555) 555-5555'>
          </div>

          <div class='field'>
            <label for='when'>Preferred timing</label>
            <select id='when' name='when'>
              <option value='asap'>As soon as possible</option>
              <option value='1week'>Within 1 week</option>
              <option value='2weeks'>2+ weeks</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class='field wide'>
            <label>Which concerns bring you here? (check any)</label>
            <div class='checkboxes'>
              <label class='pill'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='stress'> Stress</label>
              <label class='pill'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='sleep'> Sleep</label>
              <label class='pill'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='digestion'> Digestion</label>
              <label class='pill'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='inflammation'> Inflammation</label>
              <label class='pill'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='energy'> Energy</label>
              <label class='pill'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='other'> Other</label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='field wide'>
            <label for='message'>A short note about your history or goals</label>
            <textarea id='message' name='message' placeholder='A sentence or two helps us prepare.'></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class='actions wide'>
            <button type='submit' class='cta'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} <span class='sparkle'>✨</span></button>
            <button type='button' class='secondary' id='bookNow'>Quick book</button>
            <div style='margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>
          </div>

          <div style='grid-column:1/-1;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>
            By contacting us you consent to brief communications about appointments. We do not offer guaranteed cures; our approach is educational and whole-person. For urgent care call local emergency services.
          </div>
        </form>

        <section class='lead' style='margin-top:18px'>
          <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>
            <div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#f7fffc);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eef7f5'>
              <strong>Free guide</strong>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style='font-weight:700'>Free guide: Preparing for an intensive intake</div>
              <div style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>Get a checklist to gather labs, meds, and lifestyle notes — handy for your first deep visit.</div>
            </div>
            <button id='leadMagnet' class='secondary' style='margin-left:auto'>Send me the guide</button>
          </div>
        </section>

      </section>

      <aside class='card' aria-label='Contact details and quick info'>
        <h3>Contact & location</h3>
        <div class='meta'>Reach our practice in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — we blend nutrition, mind-body, botanicals, and selective testing.</div>
        <div class='contact-list'>
          <div class='pill-info'>Phone: <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' style='color:inherit;text-decoration:none'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          <div style='font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)'>Email: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:inherit;text-decoration:none'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div class='map' aria-hidden='true'>Map preview (add embed)</div>
        </div>

        <h3 style='margin-top:16px'>Meet your practitioner</h3>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>
        <div style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} offers intensive consultations focused on whole-person assessment and evidence-informed recommendations. Optional laboratory testing may be discussed as an educational tool.</div>

        <div class='testimonials'>
          <div class='testi'>
            "I felt heard — the intake was deep but friendly. Practical ideas I could try right away." <small>— A thoughtful client</small>
          </div>
          <div class='testi'>
            "The focused session helped me prioritize. No quick fixes—just clear next steps." <small>— A happy patient</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='faq'>
          <h4 style='margin:10px 0 6px 0'>Quick FAQs</h4>
          <details class='faq-item'>
            <summary>What is an intensive visit?</summary>
            <p style='margin:8px 0 0 0;color:var(--muted)'>An extended intake that reviews medical history, lifestyle, and goals. It is an educational consultation and may include lab discussion as appropriate.</p>
          </details>
          <details class='faq-item'>
            <summary>Do you prescribe medications?</summary>
            <p style='margin:8px 0 0 0;color:var(--muted)'>Prescribing depends on practitioner scope and is discussed in context. We emphasize shared decisions and education.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px'>
        <div>© <span id='year'></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — thoughtful integrative care</div>
        <div style='color:var(--muted)'>Need help? <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Simple form handler — opens booking link or mailto fallback
    const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = encodeURIComponent(form.name.value || '');
      const email = encodeURIComponent(form.email.value || '');
      const phone = encodeURIComponent(form.phone.value || '');
      const message = encodeURIComponent(form.message.value || '');
      // Open booking URL in new tab with query params if provided
      const base = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' || '';
      if(base){
        const url = base + '?name=' + name + '&email=' + email + '&phone=' + phone + '&note=' + message;
        window.open(url, '_blank');
      } else {
        // fallback: open mailto
        const mailto = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + encodeURIComponent('New intake request from ' + (form.name.value || 'someone')) + '&body=' + message + '%0A%0A' + phone;
        window.location.href = mailto;
      }
    });

    document.getElementById('bookNow').addEventListener('click', function(){
      if('{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}') window.open('{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}','_blank');
      else alert('Open booking link: {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}');
    });

    // Lead magnet quick handler
    document.getElementById('leadMagnet').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value;
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value || 'friend';
      if(!email){
        alert('Please enter your email to receive the guide.');
        return;
      }
      // Simulate sending and show playful confirmation
      this.textContent = 'Sending...';
      setTimeout(()=>{
        this.textContent = 'Guide sent!';
        alert('Thanks ' + name + '! The guide is on its way to ' + email + '.');
      },700);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
"}
{"path":"README.md","content":"Holistic / Integrative Medicine — Contact page (chunk 4)

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html  — Contact page with form, lead magnet, practitioner info, FAQs, and playful yet premium tone.
- README.md     — This file (you're reading it).

Placeholders to replace in your deployment (keep the double-brace tokens exactly as shown):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
- {{CREDENTIALS}}

Notes and usage:
- The page is intentionally self-contained: no external fonts, images, or CDN calls.
- Visual richness is provided via the inline SVG at the top of contact.html and CSS gradients.
- The contact form will open {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} in a new tab with simple query params when submitted. If {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} is empty it falls back to a mailto to {{EMAIL}}.
- The copy follows integrative/holistic care guidance: it avoids promises or cures and frames services as educational and whole-person.

Accessibility & progressive enhancement:
- Form controls are standard HTML elements. JS enhances interactions but works with mailto fallback.
- The decorative SVG is aria-hidden.

Saving the reusable SVG pattern:
- For asset reuse across other pages, save the following SVG as assets/img/pattern.svg (create folders as needed).
- The SVG below is a unique decorative pattern intended for backgrounds; it uses gradients and subtle dots.

